src/mlx_serve/sdk/quant/exl3/sushi/ is mlx-serve's copy of Sushi v1.3.0's `src/exl3` (commit 8e4c0af1), as mlx-serve
ships it (its NOTICE has the details), without its test fixtures, with the four files no build compiles code of as
stand-ins (scripts/sync-mlx-serve.sh's MODULE_STAND_INS) and only the kernels its other files name. It re-implements
turboderp/exllamav3's EXL3 format (MIT); no exllamav3 code is shipped.

