src/mlx_steel/mlx/ holds four of MLX's steel headers (defines.h, utils/type_traits.h, utils/integral_constant.h,
gemm/nax.h) from the commit in src/mlx_steel/MLX_COMMIT, the MLX the server and the kit are built from.

